#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:44
#, no-c-format
msgid "Introduction"
msgstr "Uvod"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:60
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Welcome to &kdesu;! &kdesu; is a graphical front end for the &UNIX; "
"<command>su</command> command for the K Desktop Environment. It allows you "
"to run a program as different user by supplying the password for that user. "
"&kdesu; is an unprivileged program; it uses the system's <command>su</"
"command>."
msgstr ""
"Dobrodosli u &kdesu;! &kdesu; koji je prednji graficki zavrsetak za &UNIX; "
"<command>su</command> naredbu za K Desktop Environment. Omogucava Vam da "
"pokrenete program kao novi korisnik, te Vam obezbjedjuje lozinku. &kdesu; je "
"neprivilegovan program; koristi naredbu <command>su</command> koja pripada "
"sistemu."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:66
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"&kdesu; has one additional feature: it can remember passwords for you. If "
"you are using this feature, you only need to enter the password once for "
"each command. See <xref linkend=\"sec-password-keeping\"/> for more "
"information on this and a security analysis."
msgstr ""
"&kdesu; ima jednu dodatnu odliku: moze zapamtiti Vasu lozinku. Ukoliko "
"koristite ovo svojstvo, za svaku naredbu trebate unijeti lozinku samo "
"jednom. Pogledajte <xref linkend=\"sec-password-keeping\"/> za vise "
"informacija o sigurnosti."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:72
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"This program is meant to be started from the command line or from <filename>."
"desktop</filename> files. Although it asks for the <systemitem class="
"\"username\">root</systemitem> password using a &GUI; dialog, I consider it "
"to be more of a command line &lt;-&gt; &GUI; glue instead of a pure &GUI; "
"program."
msgstr ""
"Ovaj program bi trebao biti pokrenut sa komandne linije ili iz <filename>."
"desktop</filename> datoteka. Iako trazi  <systemitem class=\"username"
"\">korijen</systemitem> lozinku pomocu &GUI; dijaloga, smatram da je to vise "
"od komandne linije &lt;-&gt; &GUI; glue umjesto cistog &GUI; programa."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:78
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Since <command>kdesu</command> is no longer installed in <userinput> $(kde4-"
"config --prefix)</userinput>/bin but in <userinput>kde4-config --path "
"libexec</userinput> and therefore not in your <envar>Path</envar>, you have "
"to use <userinput>$(kde4-config --path libexec)<command>kdesu</command></"
"userinput> to launch <command>kdesu</command>."
msgstr ""
"Buduci da <command>kdesu</command> naredba vise nije instalirana u "
"<userinput> $(kde4-config --prefix)</userinput>/bin nego u <userinput>kde4-"
"config --path libexec</userinput> pa samim tim ni u <envar>Path</envar>, "
"morate koristiti <userinput>$(kde4-config --path libexec)<command>kdesu</"
"command></userinput> za pokretanje <command>kdesu</command>."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:85
#, no-c-format
msgid "Using &kdesu;"
msgstr "Upotreba &kdesu;"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:87
#, no-c-format
msgid "Usage of &kdesu; is easy. The syntax is like this:"
msgstr "Upotreba &kdesu; je jednostavna. Sintaksa je sljedeca:"

#. Tag: cmdsynopsis
#: index.docbook:89
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<command>kdesu</command> <group choice=\"opt\"><option>-c</option> "
"<replaceable> command</replaceable></group> <group choice=\"opt\"><option>-"
"d</option></group> <group choice=\"opt\"><option>-f</option> <replaceable> "
"file</replaceable></group> <group choice=\"opt\"><option>-i</option> "
"<replaceable> icon name</replaceable></group> <group choice=\"opt\"><option>-"
"n</option></group> <group choice=\"opt\"><option>-p</option> <replaceable> "
"priority</replaceable></group> <group choice=\"opt\"><option>-r</option></"
"group> <group choice=\"opt\"><option>-s</option></group> <group choice=\"opt"
"\"><option>-t</option></group> <group choice=\"opt\"><option>-u</option> "
"<replaceable> user</replaceable></group> <group choice=\"opt\"><option>--"
"noignorebutton</option></group> <group choice=\"opt\"><option>--attach</"
"option> <replaceable> winid</replaceable></group>"
msgstr ""
"<command>kdesu</command> <group choice=\"opt\"><option>-c</option> "
"<replaceable> naredba</replaceable></group> <group choice=\"opt\"><option>-"
"d</option></group> <group choice=\"opt\"><option>-f</option> <replaceable> "
"datoteka</replaceable></group> <group choice=\"opt\"><option>-i</option> "
"<replaceable> ime ikonice</replaceable></group> <group choice=\"opt"
"\"><option>-n</option></group> <group choice=\"opt\"><option>-p</option> "
"<replaceable> priority</replaceable></group> <group choice=\"opt\"><option>-"
"r</option></group> <group choice=\"opt\"><option>-s</option></group> <group "
"choice=\"opt\"><option>-t</option></group> <group choice=\"opt\"><option>-u</"
"option> <replaceable> user</replaceable></group> <group choice=\"opt"
"\"><option>--noignorebutton</option></group> <group choice=\"opt\"><option>--"
"attach</option> <replaceable> winid</replaceable></group>"

#. Tag: cmdsynopsis
#: index.docbook:110
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<command>kdesu</command> <arg choice=\"opt\">&kde; Generic Options</arg> "
"<arg choice=\"opt\">&Qt; Generic Options</arg>"
msgstr ""
"<command>kdesu</command> <arg choice=\"opt\">&kde; Generičke Opcije</arg> "
"<arg choice=\"opt\">&Qt; Genericke Opcije</arg>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:116
#, no-c-format
msgid "The command line options are explained below."
msgstr "Opcije komandne linije su objasnjene u nastavku."

#. Tag: option
#: index.docbook:120
#, no-c-format
msgid "-c <replaceable>command</replaceable>"
msgstr "-c <replaceable>naredba</replaceable>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:121
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"This specifies the command to run as root. It has to be passed in one "
"argument. So if, for example, you want to start a new file manager, you "
"would enter at the prompt: <userinput>$(kde4-config --path "
"libexec)<command>kdesu <option>-c <replaceable> &dolphin;</replaceable></"
"option></command></userinput>"
msgstr ""
"Ovo odredjuje da se naredba pokrene kao korijen. Mora biti proslijedjena "
"jednim argumentom. Pa ukoliko, naprimjer, zelite pokrenuti novi fajl "
"menadzer, unijeli biste: <userinput>$(kde4-config --path "
"libexec)<command>kdesu <option>-c <replaceable> &dolphin;</replaceable></"
"option></command></userinput>"

#. Tag: option
#: index.docbook:127
#, no-c-format
msgid "<option>-d</option>"
msgstr "<option>-d</option>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:128
#, no-c-format
msgid "Show debug information."
msgstr "Prikazi debug informacije."

#. Tag: option
#: index.docbook:131
#, no-c-format
msgid "-f <replaceable>file</replaceable>"
msgstr "-f <replaceable>datoteka</replaceable>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:132
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"This option allow efficient use of &kdesu; in <filename>.desktop</filename> "
"files. It tells &kdesu; to examine the file specified by <parameter>file</"
"parameter>. If this file is writable by the current user, &kdesu; will "
"execute the command as the current user. If it is not writable, the command "
"is executed as user <parameter>user</parameter> (defaults to root)."
msgstr ""
"Ova opcija omogucava efikasnu upotrebu &kdesu; u <filename>.desktop</"
"filename> datotekama. Govori &kdesu; da pregleda datoteku odredjenu pomocu "
"<parameter>file</parameter>. Ako je trenutnom korisniku omoguceno pisanje u "
"ovu datoteku, &kdesu; ce izvrsiti naredbu kao trenutni korisnik. Ukoliko "
"pisanje nije omoguceno, naredba ce biti izvrsena od strane korisnika "
"<parameter>user</parameter> (zadano u korijenu)."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:138
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<parameter>file</parameter> is evaluated like this: if <parameter>file</"
"parameter> starts with a <literal>/</literal>, it is taken as an absolute "
"filename. Otherwise, it is taken as the name of a global &kde; configuration "
"file."
msgstr ""
"<parameter>file</parameter> se procjenjuje ovako: ako <parameter>file</"
"parameter> pocinje sa <literal>/</literal>, to se uzima kao potpuni naziv "
"datoteke. U protivnom, uzima se kao ime globalne &kde; konfiguracijske "
"datoteke."

#. Tag: term
#: index.docbook:144
#, no-c-format
msgid "<option>-i</option> <replaceable>icon name</replaceable>"
msgstr "<option>-i</option> <replaceable>ime ikonice</replaceable>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:145
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Specify icon to use in the password dialog. You may specify just the name, "
"without any extension."
msgstr ""
"Navedite ikonicu za dijalogu za unos lozinke. Možete navesti samo ime, bez "
"ikakvih nastavaka."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:147
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"For instance to run &konqueror; in filemanager mode and show the &konqueror; "
"icon in the password dialog:"
msgstr ""
"Nap rimjer, za pokretanje &konqueror; u filemanager modu i prikaz "
"&konqueror; ikonice uz lozinku:"

#. Tag: screen
#: index.docbook:149
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<userinput>$(kde4-config --path libexec)<command>kdesu</command>  <option>-i "
"konqueror</option> \n"
"<option>-c \"konqueror --profile filemanagement\"</option></userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>$(kde4-config --path libexec)<command>kdesu</command>  <option>-i "
"konqueror</option> \n"
"<option>-c \"konqueror --profile filemanagement\"</option></userinput>"

#. Tag: option
#: index.docbook:154
#, no-c-format
msgid "<option>-n</option>"
msgstr "<option>-n</option>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:155
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Do not keep the password. This disables the <guilabel>keep password</"
"guilabel> checkbox in the password dialog."
msgstr ""
"Ne zadrzavati lozinku. Ovo onemogucava <guilabel>zadrzati lozinku</guilabel> "
"checkbox uz lozinku."

#. Tag: term
#: index.docbook:159
#, no-c-format
msgid "<option>-p</option> <replaceable>priority</replaceable>"
msgstr "<option>-p</option> <replaceable>priority</replaceable>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:161
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Set priority value. The priority is an arbitrary number between 0 and 100, "
"where 100 means highest priority, and 0 means lowest. The default is 50."
msgstr ""
"Postaviti vrijednost priotiteta. Prioritet je proizvoljan broj između 0 i "
"100, gdje je 100 znači najviši, a 0 označava najniži prioritet. Zadani "
"prioritet je 50."

#. Tag: option
#: index.docbook:167
#, no-c-format
msgid "<option>-r</option>"
msgstr "<option>-r</option>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:168
#, no-c-format
msgid "Use realtime scheduling."
msgstr "Koristiti raspoređivanje u realnom vremenu."

#. Tag: option
#: index.docbook:173
#, no-c-format
msgid "<option>-s</option>"
msgstr "<option>-s</option>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:174
#, no-c-format
msgid "Stop the kdesu daemon. See <xref linkend=\"sec-password-keeping\"/>."
msgstr ""
"Zaustaviti kdesu demon. Vidjeti <xref linkend=\"sec-password-keeping\"/>."

#. Tag: option
#: index.docbook:178
#, no-c-format
msgid "<option>-t</option>"
msgstr "<option>-t</option>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:179
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Enable terminal output. This disables password keeping. This is largely for "
"debugging purposes; if you want to run a console mode app, use the standard "
"<command>su</command> instead."
msgstr ""
"Omogućiti izlaz iz terminala, što onemogućuje čuvanje lozinke. Ovo se "
"uglavnom koristi za svrhe debugginga; ukoliko želite pokrenuti aplikaciju u "
"console modu, radije upotrijebite  <command>su</command> ."

#. Tag: term
#: index.docbook:184
#, no-c-format
msgid "<option>-u</option> <replaceable> user</replaceable>"
msgstr "<option>-u</option> <replaceable> user</replaceable>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:185
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"While the most common use for &kdesu; is to run a command as the superuser, "
"you can supply any user name and the appropriate password."
msgstr ""
"Iako je najčešća  upotreba &kdesu;  pokrenuti naredbu kao superkorisnik, "
"možete dostaviti bilo koje korisničko ime uz odgovarajuću lozinku."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:196
#, no-c-format
msgid "Internals"
msgstr "Unutrašnjost"

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:199
#, no-c-format
msgid "X authentication"
msgstr "X ovjera"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:201
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The program you execute will run under the root user id and will generally "
"have no authority to access your X display. &kdesu; gets around this by "
"adding an authentication cookie for your display to a temporary <filename>."
"Xauthority</filename> file. After the command exits, this file is removed."
msgstr ""
"Program koji izvršavate će se pokrenuti pod root korisničkim imenom i "
"generalno neće imati ovlasti za pristup X zaslonu. &kdesu; ovo zaobilazi "
"dodavanjem ovjerenog kolačića za vaš zaslon u privremenu datoteku "
"<filename> .Xauthority </filename> . Nakon izlaza naredbe, datoteka će biti "
"uništena."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:207
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If you don't use X cookies, you are on your own. &kdesu; will detect this "
"and will not add a cookie but you will have to make sure that root is "
"allowed to access to your display."
msgstr ""
"Ako ne koristite X kolačiće, prepušteni ste sami sebi. &kdesu; će to "
"prepoznati i neće dodati kolačić, ali morat ćete osigurati da je korijenu "
"dopušten pristup vašem zaslonu."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:214
#, no-c-format
msgid "Interface to <command>su</command>"
msgstr "Interface za <command>su</command>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:216
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"&kdesu; uses the sytem's <command>su</command> for acquiring priviliges. In "
"this section, I explain the details of how &kdesu; does this."
msgstr ""
"&kdesu; koristi <command>su</command> sistema za sticanje povlastica. U ovom "
"poglavlju su objašnjeni detalj kako &kdesu; to čini."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:220
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Because some <command>su</command> implementations (&ie; the one from "
"&RedHat;) don't want to read the password from <literal>stdin</literal>, "
"&kdesu; creates a pty/tty pair and executes <command>su</command> with its "
"standard filedescriptors connected to the tty."
msgstr ""
"Pošto neke <command>su</command> implementacije (&ie; iz &RedHat;) ne čitaju "
"lozinku iz <literal>stdin</literal>, &kdesu; stvara pty/tty par i izvršava "
"<command>su</command> sa standardnim filedescriptorima povezanim sa tty."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:226
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"To execute the command the user selected, rather than an interactive shell, "
"&kdesu; uses the <option>-c</option> argument with <command>su</command>. "
"This argument is understood by every shell that I know of so it should work "
"portably. <command>su</command> passes this <option>-c</option> argument to "
"the target user's shell, and the shell executes the program. Example "
"command: <command>su <option>root -c <replaceable>the_program</replaceable></"
"option></command>."
msgstr ""
"Za izvršavanje naredbe odabrane od strane korisnika, prije nego interaktivne "
"ljuske, &kdesu; koristi <option>-c</option> argument sa <command>su</"
"command>. Svaka ljuska razumije ovaj argument, pa bi ovo trebalo raditi. "
"<command>su</command> prosljeđuje ovaj <option>-c</option> argument ciljanoj "
"ljusci, te ljuske izvršava program. Primjer naredbe: <command>su "
"<option>root -c <replaceable>the_program</replaceable></option></command>."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:234
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Instead of executing the user command directly with <command>su</command>, "
"&kdesu; executes a little stub program called <application>kdesu_stub</"
"application>. This stub (running as the target user), requests some "
"information from &kdesu; over the pty/tty channel (the stub's stdin and "
"stdout) and then executes the user's program. The information passed over "
"is: the X display, an X authentication cookie (if available), the "
"<envar>PATH</envar> and the command to run. The reason why a stub program is "
"used is that the X cookie is private information and therefore cannot be "
"passed on the command line."
msgstr ""
"Umjesto izvršavanja korisnikove naredbe direktno sa <command>su</command>, "
"&kdesu; izvršava mali dopunski program nazvan <application>kdesu_stub</"
"application>. Ova dopuna (pokrenuta kao ciljani korisnik), zahtjeva neke "
"informacije od &kdesu; preko pty/tty kanala (stdin i stdout) i izvšava "
"korisnikov program. Proslijeđena informacija je: X zaslon, X autentični "
"kolačić (ukoliko je dostupan), <envar>PATH</envar> i naredba za pokretanje. "
"Dopunski program je korišten zbog toga što je X kolačić privatna informacija "
"te stoga ne može biti proslijeđen komandnoj liniji."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:248
#, no-c-format
msgid "Password Checking"
msgstr "Provjera lozinke"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:250
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"&kdesu; will check the password you entered and gives an error message if it "
"is not correct. The checking is done by executing a test program: <filename>/"
"bin/true</filename>. If this succeeds, the password is assumed to be correct."
msgstr ""
"&kdesu; će provjeriti unesenu lozinku i dajti poruku o grešci, ukoliko "
"lozinka nije ispravna. Provjera se obavlja izvršenjem testnog programa: "
"<filename>/bin/true</filename>. Ukoliko ovo uspije, pretpostavlja se da je "
"lozinka ispravna."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:258
#, no-c-format
msgid "Password Keeping"
msgstr "Očuvanje lozinke"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:260
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"For your comfort, &kdesu; implements a <quote>keep password</quote> feature. "
"If you are interested in security, you should read this paragraph."
msgstr ""
"Za vašu udobnost, &kdesu; provodi <quote>keep password</quote> svojstvo. "
"Ukoliko ste zainteresovani za sigurnost trebali biste pročitati ovaj "
"paragraf."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:264
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Allowing &kdesu; to remember passwords opens up a (small) security hole in "
"your system. Obviously, &kdesu; does not allow anybody but your user id to "
"use the passwords, but, if done without caution, this would lowers "
"<systemitem class=\"username\">root</systemitem>'s security level to that of "
"a normal user (you). A hacker who breaks into your account, would get "
"<systemitem class=\"username\">root</systemitem> access. &kdesu; tries to "
"prevent this. The security scheme it uses is, in my opinion at least, "
"reasonably safe and is explained here."
msgstr ""
"Dozvoliti &kdesu; da zapamti lozinku stvara (malu) sigurnosnu rupu u vašem "
"sistemu. Očito, &kdesu; ne dozvoljava nikome osim vasem korisničkom id-u da "
"koristi lozinku, but, bez opreza, ovo bi moglo sniziti <systemitem class="
"\"username\">root</systemitem> sigurnosni nivo. Haker koji provali na vaš "
"account, će dobiti <systemitem class=\"username\">root</systemitem> pristup. "
"&kdesu; ovo pokušava spriječiti. Sigurnosni sistem koji koristi je sasvim "
"siguran i objašnjen ovdje."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:274
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"&kdesu; uses a daemon, called <application>kdesud</application>. The daemon "
"listens to a &UNIX; socket in <filename>/tmp</filename> for commands. The "
"mode of the socket is 0600 so that only your user id can connect to it. If "
"password keeping is enabled, &kdesu; executes commands through this daemon. "
"It writes the command and <systemitem class=\"username\">root</systemitem>'s "
"password to the socket and the daemon executes the command using "
"<command>su</command>, as describe before. After this, the command and the "
"password are not thrown away. Instead, they are kept for a specified amount "
"of time. This is the timeout value from in the control module. If another "
"request for the same command is coming within this time period, the client "
"does not have to supply the password. To keep hackers who broke into your "
"account from stealing passwords from the daemon (for example, by attaching a "
"debugger), the daemon is installed set-group-id nogroup. This should prevent "
"all normal users (including you) from getting passwords from the "
"<application>kdesud</application> process. Also, the daemon sets the "
"<envar>DISPLAY</envar> environment variable to the value it had when it was "
"started. The only thing a hacker can do is execute an application on your "
"display."
msgstr ""
"&kdesu; koristi demon, nazvan <application>kdesud</application>. Demon sluša "
"&UNIX; utičnicu u <filename>/tmp</filename> za naredbe. Način utičnice je "
"0600 tako da se samo vaš korisnički id može priključiti. Ukoliko je pamćenje "
"lozinke omogućeno, &kdesu; izvršava naredbe preko ovog demona. On upisuje "
"naredbe i  lozinku od <systemitem class=\"username\">root</systemitem> na "
"utičnicu i demon izvršava naredbi pomoću <command>su</command>, kako je već "
"objašnjeno. Nakon ovoga, naredba i loyinka nisu odbačeni. Nego se sačuvaju "
"na određenu količinu vremena. To je vrijednost timeouta u upravljačkom modu. "
"Ako u tom vremenskom periodu dolazi još jedan zahtjev za istu naredbu, "
"korisnik ne mora dati lozinku.Ya sprječavanje hakera koji provale u vaš "
"account da ukradu lozinku iz demona (naprimjer, vezivanjem debuggera), demon "
"je instalirao set-group-id nogroup. Ovo bi trebalo sve korisnike "
"(uključujući i vas) spriječiti da uyimaju lozinku iz <application>kdesud</"
"application> procesa. Također, demon postavlja <envar>DISPLAY</envar> "
"varijablu okruženja na vrijednost koju je imala na početku. Jedino što haker "
"može učiniti jeste pokrenutu aplikaciju na vašem zaslonu."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:295
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"One weak spot in this scheme is that the programs you execute are probably "
"not written with security in mind (like setuid <systemitem class=\"username"
"\">root</systemitem> programs). This means that they might have buffer "
"overruns or other problems and a hacker could exploit those."
msgstr ""
"Jedna slaba tačka u ovom projektu je da programi koje izvršavate vjerojatno "
"nisu zapisani sa sigurnosti u vidu (kao setuid <systemitem class=\"username"
"\">root</systemitem> programi). To znači da oni mogu imati buffer "
"prekoračenja ili druge probleme, koje bi haker mogao iskoristiti."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:301
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The use of the password keeping feature is a tradeoff between security and "
"comfort. I encourage you to think it over and decide for yourself if you "
"want to use it or not."
msgstr ""
"Upotreba svojstva za pamćenje lozinke je kompromis između sigurnosti i "
"komfora. Podstičem vas da dobro promislite i odlučite da li želite koristiti "
"ovo svojstvo ili ne."

